    "code": " def gcd(a,b):\n\n    if(a%b==0):\n\n        return b\n\n    else:\n\n        return gcd(b,a%b)\n\n\n\n[t1,t2,x1,x2,t0]=input().split(' ')\n\n#[t1,t2,x1,x2,t0]=[100,110,2,2,109]\n\nt1=int(t1)\n\nt2=int(t2)\n\nx1=int(x1)\n\nx2=int(x2)\n\nt0=int(t0)\n\n\n\na=t2-t0\n\nb=t0-t1\n\n\n\nif(a==0 and b==0):\n\n    print(x1,x2)\n\n    exit(0)\n\n\n\nif (a==0):\n\n    y1=0\n\n    y2=x2\n\n    print(y1,y2)\n\n    exit(0)\n\n    \n\nif (b==0):\n\n    y1=x1\n\n    y2=0\n\n    print(y1,y2)\n\n    exit(0)\n\n    \n\ng=gcd(a,b)\n\na=int(a/g)\n\nb=int(b/g)\n\nif(a<=x1 and b<=x2):\n\n    mintime=int(x1/a)\n\n    if(mintime>int(x2/b)):\n\n        mintime=int(x2/b)\n\n    print(mintime*a,mintime*b)\n\n    exit(0)\n\n\n\ny1=1\n\ny2=1\n\nminy1=1\n\nminy2=1\n\nminn=99999\n\nfg=0\n\nwhile(y1<=x1 and y2<=x2):\n\n    if(y1/y2<a/b):\n\n        if(minn>a/b-y1/y2):\n\n            minn=a/b-y1/y2\n\n            miny1=y1\n\n            miny2=y2\n\n            fg=1\n\n        y1=y1+1\n\n    else:\n\n        y2=y2+1\n\ny1=miny1\n\ny2=miny2\n\nmintime=int(x1/y1)\n\nif(mintime>int(x2/y2)):\n\n    mintime=int(x2/y2)\n\nif(fg==1):\n\n    print(mintime*y1,mintime*y2)\n\nelse:\n\n    print(0,x2)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
